# Vito's Inquisitor: "{B}, Sacrifice another creature or artifact" (CR 118.8, 701.21a): the Inquisitor can't sacrifice itself
# ("another"), nor a land (neither creature nor artifact). With no sacrifice it has no counter and no menace, so Bot2's Ornithopter
# can block it (and dies to the 3/3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Swamp
Vito's Inquisitor
Swamp x2
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x6
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Vito's Inquisitor.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Vito's Inquisitor.Activate
? Bot1.Battlefield.Vito's Inquisitor.Power = 3
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Vito's Inquisitor > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Vito's Inquisitor)
